blurb: The SOUTHPORTLANDSCHOOLDEPARTMENT Board of Education held its first budget
  workshop for the FY2025 Superintendent’sBudget, focusing on staffing adjustments,
  Multi-Tiered Systems of Support (MTSS), and critical updates from the Multilingual
  Department and McKinney-Vento programs.
